    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience the Thrill of Coin Pusher Casino!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the nostalgic world of classic coin pusher machines, now brought to life on your computer with Coin Pusher Casino. With engaging gameplay and realistic physics, this game is a must-play for arcade enthusiasts and coin pusher fans alike. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Mode:</strong> Race against time to loot the machine before time runs out.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zen Mode:</strong> Relax and enjoy chill gameplay as you loot levels at your own pace.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> Embrace the chaos with arcade-themed gameplay, featuring minigames, power-ups, and unpredictable events.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178590/extras/c72df1715934a734d6c65cc9eeb31fb9.poster.avif?t=1745241664\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178590/extras/c72df1715934a734d6c65cc9eeb31fb9.webm?t=1745241664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178590/extras/c72df1715934a734d6c65cc9eeb31fb9.mp4?t=1745241664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8<strong>0+ Levels:</strong> Explore a growing list of coin pusher machines and levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Difficulty Options:</strong> Choose your challenge level\u2014Fun Fair (easy to challenging), Coiner (medium), or Casino (hard). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Perk Shop:</strong> Upgrade your gameplay with powerful perks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Coin Shop:</strong> Obtain shiny, new playable coins. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Collectibles:</strong> Find funny, retro, and historical items. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Specials:</strong> Use consumable items with unique abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Input Support:</strong> Play with a mouse, keyboard, or game controller. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Visual Quality Settings:</strong> Optimize for energy efficiency, better FPS, or enhanced visuals for high-end PCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178590/extras/74465455fd35b7d498c1f95f304970bc.poster.avif?t=1745241664\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178590/extras/74465455fd35b7d498c1f95f304970bc.webm?t=1745241664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178590/extras/74465455fd35b7d498c1f95f304970bc.mp4?t=1745241664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Highlights:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Enjoy the retro quality and nostalgic charm of classic arcade coin pushers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> Push piles, topple walls, and crash towers of colorful coins, gold, and silver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Discovery:</strong> Unlock new levels, coin pusher machines, and treasure chests filled with surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>   